OL,3,GNEWSATwo damselfly species return to
OL,4,Arestored woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo species of damselfly have been
OL,7,Frecorded for the first time in a
OL,8,Fwoodland after the completion of a
OL,9,Fthree-year project to restore habitat
OL,10,Facross seven nature reserves, a
OL,11,Fwildlife trust has revealed.
OL,13,FWork on the Ancient Astonbury and
OL,14,FWilder Woodlands project, in
OL,15,FHertfordshire, was made possible with a
OL,16,F#162,698 grant from the National
OL,17,FLottery Heritage Fund.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
