OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATwo damselfly species return to
OL,4,Arestored woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn increase in flowers attracted more
OL,7,Fbutterflies, with Silver-washed
OL,8,FFritillaries also recorded in much
OL,9,Fhigher numbers during summer 2026 than
OL,10,Fin previous years, the Herts &
OL,11,FMiddlesex Wildlife Trust said.
OL,13,FThe Beautiful Demoiselle and Willow
OL,14,FEmerald damselflies were spotted at
OL,15,FAstonbury Wood, close to Stevenage.
